Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR_PORT (.*)
Value PortDescription (.*)
Value NEIGHBORSYSNAME (\S+)
Value MANAGEMENT_IP (\S+)
Value MANAGEMENT_TYPE (\S+)

Start
  ^------------------
  ^Local\sport\s+:${LOCAL_INTERFACE}
  ^Chassis\sID\s+:${CHASSIS_ID}
  ^Port\sdescription\s+:${PortDescription}
  ^Port\sID\s+:\s*${NEIGHBOR_PORT}
  ^System\sname\s+:${NEIGHBORSYSNAME}
  ^Management\saddress\s+:${MANAGEMENT_TYPE}-${MANAGEMENT_IP},.*
  ^$$ -> Record



